  "label": "Dehumanizing Metaphor",
  "description": "The metaphor of sperm is used to reduce human beings to biological statistics, which is a dehumanizing tactic that strips away their individuality and humanity. This is a common rhetorical device in xenophobic discourse to make it easier to dismiss or vilify a group.",
